WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.240 --> 00:00:04.080
Another Thing That Doctor Bright Is&nbsp;
Not Allowed To Do At The Foundation:&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:04.080 --> 00:00:09.200
Dr. Bright must be informed that&nbsp;
SCP-018 is not to be taunted!

00:00:09.200 --> 00:00:13.760
SCP-018 is also known as the Super Ball,&nbsp;
and it’s a small rubber ball created by&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:13.760 --> 00:00:18.720
the Wham-O corporation, with the frightening and&nbsp;
destructive ability to bounce higher and faster&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:18.720 --> 00:00:22.240
every single time it bounces,&nbsp;
resulting in rampant chaos.

00:00:22.240 --> 00:00:28.000
So naturally, Dr. Bright has, on occasion, gotten&nbsp;
it out of containment to try bouncing it around,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:28.000 --> 00:00:30.960
likely destroying large amounts&nbsp;
of Foundation office equipment&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:30.960 --> 00:00:33.680
and terrorizing all nearby staff members.

00:00:33.680 --> 00:00:38.640
As such, his privileges around the Super&nbsp;
Ball have been revoked, and the O5 Council&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:38.640 --> 00:00:43.840
has advised that Dr. Bright sticks to a&nbsp;
simple, non-anomalous paddle ball instead.

